# Subagent models — inherit only

When launching Task / subagents for this repo (ticket-batch, implement, review, explore helpers):

- Pass **`model: "inherit"`** (or omit model so the parent Auto/Composer model is used).
- Do **not** select Claude, Grok, Gemini, GPT, Muse, or other “Other Models” slugs unless the user names one in that turn.

Scout/explore agents that take no model argument stay as-is.
